    "title": "Carpet Cleaning CRM and Lead Management: Turning Calls Into Booked Jobs",
    "description": "How carpet cleaning CRM and lead management software captures every inquiry, follows up automatically, and converts more calls into booked, paying jobs.",
    "date": "2026-01-07",
